# Tasks Module

> Centralized work management system for acquisition, title, curative, closing, and operations teams.

---

# Overview

The Tasks module provides a centralized workspace for managing operational activities across the entire acquisition lifecycle.

Tasks are automatically created by workflows or manually assigned by users to ensure every acquisition progresses efficiently.

Every task is linked to a Deal, Owner, Asset, Campaign, or Closing record, providing complete operational visibility.

---

# Objectives

The Tasks module enables users to:

- Assign operational work
- Track task completion
- Prioritize activities
- Monitor deadlines
- Coordinate across departments
- Automate recurring work
- Maintain accountability
- Improve operational efficiency

