# Business Rules

## Rule 1

Every task must have an assigned owner.

---

## Rule 2

Critical tasks require a due date.

---

## Rule 3

Completed tasks become read-only.

---

## Rule 4

Cancelled tasks require a reason.

---

## Rule 5

All status changes are recorded in the audit log.

